1/files/cnet_3652787d-d28e-4bab-992c-7c8880dd9f10.png?v=1692337678 1536w" width="360" height="240" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-hmvnCu drWcAT pf-228_"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-iAKWXU lesjfG pf-229_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-230_"><p class="sc-bvFjSx yVjXo pf-231_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Monument Grills represents a commitment to delivering high-quality grills that are built to last, and the spirit of constant innovation. The company spent a lot of time gathering customer feedback, keeping up with industry trends, and incorporating the latest technological advancements.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-233_"><p class="sc-bvFjSx yVjXo pf-234_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><br>This&nbsp;6-Burner Clearview Propane Gas Grill from&nbsp;Monument Grills is with a small price tag. 96,000 Btus and 900 square inches of cooking space (thanks to a side burner and a ceramic sear burner, in addition to the six burners under the lid). You can watch your ‘cue without raising the hood, plus track the temperature inside with its built-in thermometer.</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-236_"><p class="sc-bvFjSx yVjXo pf-237_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">While a giant six-burner grill may not be for everyone, the Monument Denali is the perfect balance of modern thinking, a good price, and quality that I would expect from our top pick. When space is limited, the&nbsp;tabletop propane gas grill from Monument is compact on the outside but surprisingly large on the inside. It's big enough to cook a spatchcocked turkey or several large steaks.</p></div></div></div><div class="sc-iAKWXU lesjfG pf-239_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-240_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1639/3511/files/03_360x.png?v=1691658182" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1639/3511/files/03.png?v=1691658182 1536w" width="360" height="240" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-hmvnCu drWcAT pf-241_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-242_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1639/3511/files/06_353388c8-bcb6-4f50-aea8-b3603abc377a_360x.png?v=1691660387" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1639/3511/files/06_353388c8-bcb6-4f50-aea8-b3603abc377a.png?v=1691660387 1536w" width="360" height="240" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-hmvnCu drWcAT pf-243_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-244_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1639/3511/files/08_bc4e1a61-e3b4-421e-b546-242089c7c362_360x.png?v=1691660485" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1639/3511/files/08_bc4e1a61-e3b4-421e-b546-242089c7c362.png?v=1691660485 1536w" width="360" height="240" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-hmvnCu drWcAT pf-245_"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-iAKWXU lesjfG pf-246_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-247_"><p class="sc-bvFjSx yVjXo pf-248_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"> The general consensus&nbsp;is that the Monument Grills 77352 6 Burner Propane Gas Grill is a really cool barbecue cart with awesome visual appeal and a lot of features which make it a do-anything garden cooking essential. It grills well, cleans easily, and the vast majority of user reviews are overwhelmingly positive - given the reasonable price tag, this is a whole lot of grill for the cash.&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-250_"><p class="sc-bvFjSx yVjXo pf-251_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">&nbsp;Monument Grills is a well-known name in the grilling industry.&nbsp; One of the biggest benefits of Monument gas grills is that you do not have to wait too long for it to heat up. People use Monument Grills because they enjoy the convenience of it.</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-253_"><p class="sc-bvFjSx yVjXo pf-254_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The Monument Grills is a stand-out among mid-range grills for its abundance of features, such as a rotisserie grill, side burners, LED knobs, and powerful main burners, and its exceptionally large grilling space that rivals those of higher-end models.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-0cbb" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-cqJhZP gdQPUt pf-256_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jefHZX kyAaUw"><div class="sc-iAKWXU lesjfG pf-257_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-cTAIfT dQNWym pf-258_"><h3 tabindex="0" spellcheck="fal